    "text": "A musician using an open flute of length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>cm</mi></math> produces second harmonic sound waves. A person runs towards the musician from another end of a hall at a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. If the wave speed is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>330</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>, the frequency heard by the running person shall be close to",
